    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "03. Moving",
    "ruleNumber": "03.04",
    "summary": "Engagement Range extends 2 inches horizontally and 5 inches vertically. Use Measuring Distances to check from the nearest point of the base, or the nearest point of the model itself for a FRAME model. Whenever a friendly model is within an enemy model’s range, both models become engaged with each other, as do their units. A unit with no engaged models counts as unengaged.",
